### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health
Accept: application/json

### Ping Check
GET http://localhost:8080/ping
Accept: application/json

### Rate Limited Endpoint without Token
GET http://localhost:8080/protected
Accept: application/json

### Rate Limited Endpoint with Token
GET http://localhost:8080/protected HTTP/1.1
API_KEY: ec630fcfc104de84a7497e0fb4554dc4

### Create API Key
POST http://localhost:8080/api-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time_window": 3600,
  "max_requests": 10,
  "blocked_duration": 20
}